        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Don-Jo 1401 1-13/16\" Adhesive Wall Bumper</b>\r\n<p>\r\nLarge round 1-13/16\" adhesive wall bumper is easy to install, just peel and stick in your desired location. \r\nThe rubber bumper is concave in the center to accept the locking push button of a door knob/lever, so it will not self lock. \r\n<p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/don-jo-1401_size.gif?v=1704354550\" width=\"600\" height=\"200\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Don-Jo 1401 Adhesive Wall Bumper Size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThese stick-on door bumpers are  used everywhere  from homes to schools to retail shopping malls. Anywhere you need to prevent damage from a door crashing into a wall or other object. Available in Gray or White rubber.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Don-Jo 1401 Adhesive Door Bumper\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-13/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Rubber Color: Optional Gray or White</li>\r\n\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/1401.pdf?v=1704262330\" target=\"new\"><b>Don-Jo 1401  Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p><b>*Sold Individually</b>\r\n</p>",
