                "description": "Don-Jo 1401 Adhesive Wall Bumpers. Large round 1-13/16 adhesive wall bumper is easy to install, just peel and stick in your desired location. \r\nThe rubber bumper is concave in the center to accept the locking push button of a door knob/lever, so it will not self lock. Available in Gray or White rubber.",
